chuyuan","book_id":"b-shiji-050","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-050-chuyuan"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:p017","text":"初，吳王之度淮，與楚王遂西敗棘壁，乘勝前，銳甚。梁孝王恐，遣六將軍擊吳，又敗梁兩將，士卒皆還走梁。梁數使使報條侯求救，條侯不許。又使使惡條侯於上，上使人告條侯救梁，復守便宜不行。梁使韓安國及楚死事相弟張羽為將軍，乃得頗敗吳兵。吳兵欲西，梁城守堅，不敢西，即走條侯軍，會下邑。欲戰，條侯壁，不肯戰。吳糧絕，卒饑，數挑戰，遂夜奔條侯壁，驚東南。條侯使備西北，果從西北入。吳大敗，士卒多饑死，乃畔散。於是吳王乃與其麾下壯士數千人夜亡去，度江走丹徒，保東越。東越兵可萬餘人，乃使人收聚亡卒。漢使人以利啗東越，東越即紿吳王，吳王出勞軍，即使人鏦殺吳王，盛其頭，馳傳以聞。吳王子子華、子駒亡走閩越。吳王之棄其軍亡也，軍遂潰，往往稍降太尉、梁軍。楚王戊軍敗，自殺。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"吳王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_CA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"楚王","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_DCA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"梁孝王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACG","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0054","start":54,"end":56,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"上","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"上","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"條侯","kind":"person","person_id":"koy_6jg_gcc_C","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-106-wuwang:m017-0091","start":91,"end":94,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person",